WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.964 --> 00:00:03.566
It's called the Alamainian Peacock...

00:00:03.566 --> 00:00:04.400
[click]

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:04.968
[smash]

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:07.403
and it was stolen in 1991.
[siren]

00:00:10.206 --> 00:00:12.208
Their gems have fallen
 into the wrong hands.

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:15.244
So why do I feel there's more to
this story than you're telling?

00:00:15.244 --> 00:00:17.780
We are going to
find out who did this.

00:00:19.182 --> 00:00:21.117
No one is going to
stop me from getting it.

00:00:22.619 --> 00:00:24.354
God helps those
who help themselves. 

00:00:26.623 --> 00:00:28.625
That is the most beautiful
 thing I’ve ever seen.

00:00:30.493 --> 00:00:31.194
Whoa!

00:00:31.894 --> 00:00:33.096
What the hell is goin’ on?

00:00:33.096 --> 00:00:34.364
[gun shot]
Hey!

00:00:41.604 --> 00:00:43.239
So who are you supposed to be?

